<title>USA: Laboratorio Chile SA names new CEO.</title>
<headline>Laboratorio Chile SA names new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laboratorio Chile SA said on Thursday it has named Rodolfo Ham as its new chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Ham, who has been deputy chief executive officer, succeeds Francisco Undurrago, who resigned from the post on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Laboratorio Chile manufactures pharmaceutical products.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
